# A planted ledger: the facts of the planted program, and a needed library that goes.
format 1
rule artifact-links
@build/tools | needed | 1 | libc.so.6 | -
@build/tools | needed | 1 | libgcc_s.so.1 | -
@build/tools | needed | 1 | libm.so.6 | -
@build/tools | needed | 1 | libplanted_gone.so.1 | -
@build/tools | needed | 1 | libstdc++.so.6 | -
@build/tools | static-member | 1 | libc_nonshared.a(atexit.oS) | -
